70
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san... what are...?</font>

71
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:46,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing, nii-san?!</font>

72
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:49,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You pathetic younger brother...</font>

73
00:05:57,290 --> 00:05:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mangekyo Sharingan!</font>

74
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:11,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! Nii-san!</font>

75
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:15,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't make me see
this kind of thing!</font>

76
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?!</font>

77
00:06:18,690 --> 00:06:20,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san, why did you...?!</font>

78
00:06:48,380 --> 00:06:49,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...</font>

79
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:54,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san... Why did you...?</font>

80
00:06:57,770 --> 00:07:01,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to measure my vessel...</font>

81
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:05,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To measure your vessel?</font>

82
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:08,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that all?</font>

83
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only for that reason...
you killed everybody...?</font>

84
00:07:20,290 --> 00:07:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is what is important.</font>

85
00:07:23,710 --> 00:07:25,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is that?</font>

86
00:07:28,550 --> 00:07:31,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You gotta be kidding!</font>

87
00:07:53,410 --> 00:07:54,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm scared...</font>

88
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:56,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm scared!</font>

89
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't kill me...!</font>

90
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:43,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't believe it!</font>

91
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is too unlike you, nii-san.
I mean...</font>

92
00:08:47,380 --> 00:08:50,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason I acted as the big brother
you desired was...</font>

93
00:08:51,510 --> 00:08:54,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because I wanted to
measure your vessel.</font>

94
00:08:55,970 --> 00:09:00,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have the potential
to become my opponent.</font>

95
00:09:00,810 --> 00:09:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order for me to measure
my vessel.</font>

96
00:09:05,310 --> 00:09:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You hated me...</font>

97
00:09:10,070 --> 00:09:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you continued to have
the desire to surpass me.</font>

98
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's exactly why
I will allow you to live...</font>

99
00:09:17,110 --> 00:09:19,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for my own benefit.</font>

100
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:24,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are someone who could be able to use
Mangekyo Sharingan just like me.</font>

101
00:09:27,210 --> 00:09:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, on one condition...</font>

102
00:09:34,550 --> 00:09:39,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That you must kill
your closest friend...</font>

103
00:09:42,770 --> 00:09:44,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You've gotta be kidding...</font>

104
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:52,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like I did...</font>

105
00:09:54,030 --> 00:09:56,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Regarding Uchiha Shisui
who committed suicide last night</font>

106
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:59,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by throwing himself into
the Nakano River...</font>

107
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:05,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The other one that did not show up
to the meeting is Shisui...</font>

108
00:10:05,660 --> 00:10:08,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I remember correctly...</font>

109
00:10:08,210 --> 00:10:10,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you adored him like
he was your real older brother...</font>

110
00:10:11,710 --> 00:10:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was... your doing...?</font>

111
00:10:16,170 --> 00:10:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san, you... killed Shisui-san?!</font>

112
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:23,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right... and because of
that I obtained these eyes.</font>

113
00:10:25,930 --> 00:10:28,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The main hall of Nakano Shrine...</font>

114
00:10:28,350 --> 00:10:31,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Underneath the seventh tatami mat
on the far right</font>

115
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the secret gathering place
of the Clan.</font>

116
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:39,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There you will find recorded
the secret of...</font>

117
00:10:39,860 --> 00:10:46,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the true purpose of
the Uchiha Clan's Visual Jutsu.</font>

118
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:50,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The secret of the true purpose...?</font>

119
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:54,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you attain these eyes,</font>

120
00:10:54,380 --> 00:10:57,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will become the third person
including myself</font>

121
00:10:57,260 --> 00:11:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to utilize
the Mangekyo Sharingan.</font>

122
00:11:01,470 --> 00:11:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that happens...</font>

123
00:11:04,390 --> 00:11:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then there will have been meaning
in my allowing you to live.</font>

124
00:11:07,810 --> 00:11:10,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However... at present...</font>

125
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are not worth killing.</font>

126
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My pathetic younger brother...</font>

127
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:20,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to kill me
then begrudge me!</font>

128
00:11:20,490 --> 00:11:21,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hate me!</font>

129
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:25,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And live in an ugly manner...</font>

130
00:11:25,870 --> 00:11:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run away... run away...
and cling to life...</font>

131
00:11:30,660 --> 00:11:34,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And one day, when you have
the same eyes as I do...</font>

132
00:11:35,290 --> 00:11:37,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">come and stand before me!</font>

133
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A dream...?</font>

134
00:12:14,330 --> 00:12:16,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... that's right.</font>

135
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:19,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only one who survived...
is that boy.</font>

136
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't he have
an older brother?</font>

137
00:12:24,590 --> 00:12:27,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, but he's gone missing...</font>

138
00:12:30,430 --> 00:12:34,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be true...
That elite Uchiha Clan...</font>

139
00:13:03,050 --> 00:13:07,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hi, Sasuke-chan! What did you
come to buy today?</font>

140
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:45,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-chan, are you on your way to school?</font>

141
00:13:46,010 --> 00:13:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

142
00:13:50,180 --> 00:13:53,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I saw Itachi-chan earlier
but he's very admirable, isn't he?</font>

143
00:13:53,890 --> 00:13:56,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's already become
a top-class Shinobi.</font>

144
00:13:56,730 --> 00:13:59,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He graduated from the Ninja Academy
at the top of his class at age seven</font>

145
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attained the rank
of Chunin at age ten, didn't he?</font>

146
00:14:03,530 --> 00:14:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was able to use Sharingan
when he was eight!</font>

147
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:10,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's true, isn't it?</font>

148
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy is truly the pride
of the Uchiha Clan.</font>

149
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:55,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome home... Sasuke!</font>

150
00:15:26,150 --> 00:15:27,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...!</font>

151
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:29,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a second...</font>

152
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:31,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

153
00:15:41,830 --> 00:15:42,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother?!</font>

154
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:57,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why only nii-san!</font>

155
00:16:01,140 --> 00:16:04,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your brother's your brother.
And you are you.</font>

156
00:16:04,350 --> 00:16:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father cares deeply
about both of you.</font>

157
00:16:57,410 --> 00:17:00,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The main hall of Nakano Shrine...</font>

158
00:17:01,950 --> 00:17:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Located underneath
the seventh tatami mat on the far right</font>

159
00:17:05,170 --> 00:17:07,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is our clan's secret gathering place...</font>

160
00:17:14,510 --> 00:17:18,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... So that's what it is...</font>

161
00:17:20,310 --> 00:17:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{"Ninja Academy"</b></font>

162
00:17:24,230 --> 00:17:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Shikamaru...</font>

163
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:28,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wanna go to the candy shop
after school?</font>

164
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:29,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... No way.</font>

165
00:17:30,110 --> 00:17:33,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can do that 'cuz
your mother's nice,</font>

166
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:36,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but if my mother found out that I bought
myself a snack before going home,</font>

167
00:17:36,990 --> 00:17:39,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd be in big trouble.</font>

168
00:17:39,990 --> 00:17:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you hear the news...</font>

169
00:17:41,450 --> 00:17:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that entire Uchiha Clan
was apparently murdered?</font>

170
00:17:44,710 --> 00:17:47,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, my dad told me.</font>

171
00:17:48,250 --> 00:17:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Apparently he's the only one
who survived.</font>

172
00:18:07,020 --> 00:18:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my boy.</font>

173
00:18:10,770 --> 00:18:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With me, you're all
your father talks about...</font>

174
00:18:21,030 --> 00:18:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder... what kind of things
Father was saying to Mother...</font>

175
00:18:37,550 --> 00:18:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to kill me...</font>

176
00:18:39,760 --> 00:18:41,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begrudge me! Hate me!</font>

177
00:18:49,600 --> 00:18:51,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's for the purpose of killing you,</font>

178
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:55,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will rush headfirst into whatever
darkness which may lie ahead!</font>

179
00:18:56,190 --> 00:18:59,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will obtain that power no matter what!</font>

180
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:03,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From this point onwards,
I am an avenger!</font>

181
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:09,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke is now
in depths of darkness...</font>

182
00:19:10,710 --> 00:19:12,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you stop in a place like this...</font>

183
00:19:12,670 --> 00:19:15,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you won't be able to catch up
with Sasuke.</font>

184
00:19:35,820 --> 00:19:38,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, it's just like you said.</font>

185
00:19:39,320 --> 00:19:41,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy looks like he's in
the depths of darkness right now...</font>

186
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He really hit me with
his full strength! Damn it!</font>

187
00:19:52,460 --> 00:19:58,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you consider me...
your comrade any longer?!</font>

188
00:19:59,460 --> 00:20:04,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't all those things we did together
in Team 7 mean anything to you?!</font>

189
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:08,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

190
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will get my hands on
that power no matter what.</font>

191
00:20:15,230 --> 00:20:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wasn't meaningless...</font>

192
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:23,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To me you became my...
closest friend.</font>

193
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:27,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've become... friends?</font>

194
00:20:28,740 --> 00:20:30,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... why?!</font>

195
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:32,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All the more reason why...</font>

196
00:20:33,370 --> 00:20:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All the more reason why...</font>

197
00:20:35,170 --> 00:20:38,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's meaning in taking
you down.</font>

198
00:20:44,010 --> 00:20:46,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't fully understand but...</font>

199
00:20:46,930 --> 00:20:50,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understood that you want to
fight me with your everything!</font>

200
00:20:51,390 --> 00:20:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...!</font>

201
00:21:12,380 --> 00:21:17,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

202
00:21:12,380 --> 00:21:17,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

203
00:21:17,150 --> 00:21:23,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

204
00:21:17,150 --> 00:21:23,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I felt as though I had understood everything</font></font></font></font>

205
00:21:23,550 --> 00:21:27,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">iroaseta kotoba wa</font></font></font></font>

206
00:21:23,550 --> 00:21:27,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">faded words</font></font></font></font>

207
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">boku no sugu soba ni oite atta</font></font></font></font>

208
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">which I kept so close to me</font></font></font></font>

209
00:21:34,330 --> 00:21:39,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kotae no denai yoru to</font></font></font></font>

210
00:21:34,330 --> 00:21:39,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">speechless nights,</font></font></font></font>

211
00:21:39,910 --> 00:21:44,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a hint of warmth,</font></font></font></font>

212
00:21:39,950 --> 00:21:44,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitokira no nukumori to</font></font></font></font>

213
00:21:45,660 --> 00:21:50,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">and this distant yearning for you</font></font></font></font>

214
00:21:45,710 --> 00:21:50,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">haruka kanata no akogare to</font></font></font></font>

215
00:21:51,130 --> 00:21:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I live,</font></font></font></font>

216
00:21:51,170 --> 00:21:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">tada sore dake wo</font></font></font></font>

217
00:21:53,960 --> 00:22:00,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">simply repeating this cycle</font></font></font></font>

218
00:21:54,010 --> 00:22:00,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kurikaeshi boku wa ikite iru</font></font></font></font>

219
00:22:02,100 --> 00:22:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">held in my two hands</font></font></font></font>

220
00:22:02,140 --> 00:22:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono ryoute ni kakaete iru mono</font></font></font></font>

221
00:22:08,980 --> 00:22:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a droplet of time</font></font></font></font>

222
00:22:09,020 --> 00:22:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">toki no shizuku</font></font></font></font>

223
00:22:13,020 --> 00:22:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">softly clutching forgotten memories</font></font></font></font>

224
00:22:13,070 --> 00:22:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">sotto nigirishimete wasureta kioku</font></font></font></font>

225
00:22:19,360 --> 00:22:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">lost words</font></font></font></font>

226
00:22:19,410 --> 00:22:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">nakushita kotoba</font></font></font></font>

227
00:22:31,130 --> 00:22:35,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I'll keep these thoughts...</font></font></font></font>

228
00:22:31,170 --> 00:22:35,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono omoi wa</font></font></font></font>

229
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Are you trying to take me
down for real?</font>

230
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I don't know any longer</font>

231
00:22:45,840 --> 00:22:48,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">whether you really meant
what you said earlier or not!</font>

232
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:53,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Could it be that it was only I
who thought we were friends?</font>

233
00:22:54,220 --> 00:22:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If that's the case,
I'm just a really lame guy</font>

234
00:22:59,020 --> 00:23:00,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Aren't I? Sasuke?</font>

235
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:03,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Friend!"</font>

